<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS shares index hits record 388.99.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS shares index hits record 388.99.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System index of 22 leading shares closed up almost three percent at a record 388.99 on Thursday on a strong $73.3 million total market turnover.</p>
<p>The previous record was set on Wednesday, when the index closed at 377.69.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
